This Benchmark folder benchmarks the Debye spin-boson model against Tom Fay's code.

It does the debye code, with:
1. Matsubara + Ishizaki-Tanimura Low-T correction
2. [N/N] Pade with no low-T correction
3. [N-1/N] Pade with no low-T correction

The results of 1 and 3 should be exactly the same as Tom's code, 
but, due to the omission of a term, the results of 2 will differ (very) slightly.

NOTE: any files with .out or .txt will be deleted when you run the benchmark (as it clears the folder).